  <item>
    <title>vol.3 六年大学，我一直在寻找《生活》这张文凭。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/674048118d1233fb0d3373b3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">674048118d1233fb0d3373b3</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 22 Nov 2024 09:49:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期，我们邀请了两位和主播谢宇2018年同年入学的大学同学——李烧鸡和谢非凡。但他们一个晚了一年毕业、一个晚了两年毕业。上学期间按下暂停键的他们回忆起了休学的经历和“非标”的求学工作之旅。真抑郁、假抑郁；工作中穿上“皇帝的新衣”；懵懂少年对“生活”的实验；独一无二的有趣故事……</span></p><span></span><p><span>相识多年的他们在欢声笑语中调侃着彼此的经历，但每段笑声背后却隐藏着每个人的迷茫与无助。这三个初入社会的少年对“生活”这个课题又参透了几分呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>更多精彩内容，欢迎收听本期节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播 / 谢宇</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾 / 李烧鸡 谢非凡</span></p><span></span><p><span>声音设计 /&nbsp;Freeland</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：《海浪》——deca joins</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="22">00:00:22</a>逆天开场白</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">00:01:20</a> 嘉宾自我介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="155">00:02:35</a> 回忆彼此刚认识的抽象画面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="385">00:06:25</a> 描述对嘉宾们主观的刻板印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="470">00:07:50</a> 高中埋下一颗“对上不信任”对非标种子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="734">00:12:14</a> 非凡第一次休学的emo经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="981">00:16:21</a> 烧鸡休学的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1070">00:17:50</a> 烧鸡的“假病”休学流程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1219">00:20:19</a> 烧鸡休学实习经历对虚荣和生活的思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1362">00:22:42</a> 非凡的“生活”实验——“桃桃居”生活俱乐部</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1645">00:27:25</a> 非凡跟打领导踢“人情事故”足球</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1943">00:32:23</a> 非凡“足球”生活引发的感悟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2065">00:34:25</a> 谢宇“找台阶”金句！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2110">00:35:10</a> 烧鸡工作后迷茫了，直面自己的“虚荣心”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2348">00:39:08</a> 清远旅行分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2468">00:41:08</a> 旅行过程中找到了“回怼”老板的答案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2548">00:42:28</a> 烧鸡通过跟我们的旅行悟了生活的真谛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2772">00:46:12</a> 非凡也想像烧鸡一样有个“社会身份”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2805">00:46:45</a> 非凡把工作内化到“生活”的实验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">00:50:00</a> 实验艺术《早，但黑八》的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3096">00:51:36</a> 非凡对于自己目前做的这些无法获得“社会身份”的工作仍有些不自洽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3135">00:52:15</a> 谢宇慷慨激昂鼓励大伙，得自洽！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3364">00:56:04</a> 我们应该更注重思考“生活”这个课题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3415">00:56:55</a> 烧鸡掏心掏肺谈大伙的多元“生活”给自己的启发</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3457">00:57:37</a> 烧鸡眼中《个人所得说》的意义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">01:00:00</a> 听歌吧！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lj_TBxAH408EPfwEwMfsgGuKLO4w.m4a" length="125245394" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:04:51</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpXAwJslW5rRWelamVWHXrbLib4q.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>vol.2 从瞒着妈妈纹身，到辍学成为纹身店老板。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/672dbe2582eb19451d21d551</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">672dbe2582eb19451d21d551</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 08 Nov 2024 07:47:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>从本期开始，我们将陆续邀请各行各业不走斑马线的“非标毕业生”们，来分享他们步入社会后不同寻常的精彩故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这次，我们邀请了一位全职纹身师——池田KUSU同学。她呢，甚至还没毕业的时候就开始横穿马路。池田同学分享了自己从偶然接触纹身，到毅然辍学进入“纹身社会大学”，再到摸爬滚打找到自己赛道，慢慢积累，终于开了属于自己的纹身店。过程可谓是叛逆且励志！同时呢，她也给大家分享了很多纹身职业中有趣的故事和冷门小科普。</span></p><span></span><p><span>作为认识多年的老同学，池田同学也见证参与了主播谢宇同学早期“横穿马路”的各种实验。他们就“当自己的审美体系进入市场会面临的问题”进行了讨论，初入社会的他们也是摔了不少跟头。</span></p><span></span><p><span>更多精彩内容，欢迎收听本期节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播 / 谢宇</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾 / 池田KUSU</span></p><span></span><p><span>音频后期 / Freeland</span></p><span></span><p><span>配乐制作 / Freeland</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面摄影 / Zeelam</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾音乐：《We‘ll follow the wind》—吴卓玲</span></p><span></span><p><span>Timeline：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="47">00:00:47</a> 嘉宾锐评上期节目</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="144">00:02:24</a> 嘉宾介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="290">00:04:50</a> 怎么接触到纹身这个事情的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="415">00:06:55</a> 第一个纹身被妈妈发现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="619">00:10:19</a> 课余时间当纹身学徒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="728">00:12:08</a> 疫情期间毅然辍学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">00:15:00</a> 开启全职纹身小白生涯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="996">00:16:36</a> 初入“纹身大学”的困境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1442">00:24:02</a> 勇闯省城自己当老板</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1933">00:32:13</a> 纹身和穿孔的疼痛科普</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2187">00:36:27</a> 关于自己的纹身</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2747">00:45:47</a> 客人有意义的纹身故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2860">00:47:40</a> 小众客人的猎奇纹身故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3100">00:51:40</a> 抽象客人的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3215">00:53:35</a> 恰饭与个人风格发展的平衡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3334">00:55:34</a> 个人审美体系进入市场的困境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3868">01:04:28</a> 未来的小计划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4090">01:08:10</a> 听歌吧</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lv4uLCTcj00UxLNfny9P1yy59exI.m4a" length="134998245" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:09:54</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnz4cYFQCRvJL9G3gofav6r7Xl06.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>vol.1 那年毕业，找工作的我把上市大厂骂上了热搜</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6722bc7b33c798676f3fe57a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6722bc7b33c798676f3fe57a</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 31 Oct 2024 08:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>毕业两年左右，这帮第一批踏入社会的00后们都活得还好吗？他们的工作与生活都有些什么特别的故事呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>第一期节目，我们邀请了一位22年毕业的“标准毕业生”——吴骅晋同学，来开启我们这档播客。这几年，他不是在上班就是在找上班的路上，可谓是班味十足。骅晋同学也分享了这几年求职跌宕起伏的心路历程，从大学时期在大厂的实习，到毕业后被毁约offer，再到​异乡被无情n+1。同时呢，自命不凡的他也做了一件整顿职场的疯狂事情。而我们的主播谢宇同学，作为“非标毕业生”的代表人物，他毕业后的选择与骅晋截然不同。他们从现实的就业选择聊到了理想化的个人追求，嬉笑怒骂之间道着刚踏入社会的迷茫与思考。</span></p><span></span><p><span>更多精彩内容，欢迎收听本期节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播 / 谢宇</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾 / 吴骅晋</span></p><span></span><p><span>音频后期 / Freeland</span></p><span></span><p><span>配乐制作 / Freeland</span></p><span></span><p><span>Timeline：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="138">00:02:18</a> 这档播客到底是聊啥的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="455">00:07:35</a> 骅晋同学的求职经历概述</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="673">00:11:13</a> 校招签了三方被上市大厂毁约offer</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="932">00:15:32</a> 维权愤怒发声将上市大厂骂上热搜</span></p><span></span><p><span>​<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1292">00:21:32</a> 大学时期找实习的驱动力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1485">00:24:45</a> 终于上岸入职但被无情n+1</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1732">00:28:52</a> 谢宇同学为什么不找工作呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1983">00:33:03</a> 刚毕业时就业选择的困境与现实的思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2380">00:39:40</a> 期待接下来更多“非标毕业生”的故事吧！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrjNnhaNEnTP_Spn5nixJDP_CYnb.m4a" length="29901657" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:40:53</itunes:duration>
